== Notes ==
* If Isaac gets {{i|Key Piece 1}} and {{i|Key Piece 2}}, the key will open the golden gate to fight Mega Satan, but if Isaac uses {{i|Forget Me Now}}, the floor will reset and Isaac won't get both Key Pieces back, making it so that the golden gate won't open again.
* {{dlc|anr}} It is possible to create trapdoors thanks to {{e|Reward Plate}}s (found for example in a {{r|Secret Room}}). Upon entering them, the floor is restarted. If the large golden door was opened before restarting, it will be closed afterward.
** This may result in a softlock on a Daily Run to Mega Satan, if no other way of opening the door is found.
* {{dlc|anr}} The {{r|I AM ERROR}} room cannot be reached by any method in the Chest and the {{s|Dark Room}}.
** {{dlc+|r}} The {{r|I AM ERROR}} room can be reached by leaving a {{r|Crawl Space}} through an unintended direction. The room will always contain a portal leading to {{s|The Void}}.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc|r}} If a {{e|Red Chest}} is placed in the starting room, it will contain a [[Devil deal]], similar to the {{s|Dark Room}}.

